## 2. Workflow Pipeline — Stage by Stage

```mermaid
flowchart TB

    START([User enters goal\nor selects Airtable item])

    subgraph PLAN[① Coordinator Planning]
        P1[Read context files\ncompany · strategy · current-state · repos]
        P2[Query Knowledge Base\nNotion or GitBook if configured]
        P3[COORDINATOR_READY\nenriched context · max 3 rounds]
        P4[User toggles stages\nconfirm scope]
    end

    subgraph LOOP[② Per-Stage Execution Loop]
        L1[Coordinator generates Stage Brief\nincludes productArea platform scope]
        L2[Specialist runs\nloads persona from skill_versions\nloads output template\nstreams via LLM]
        L3{Validation Tool\ncalled inline by specialist}
        L4[Self-correct\nrevise based on tool issues]
        L5[Flint — Critic\nloads critic-stage.md\nqualitative checks only]
        L6[Checkpoint created\npending human review]
    end

    subgraph STAGES[③ Stage Sequence]
        S1[Sage — Analyst\nvalidate_research_brief]
        S2[Rex — PM / PRD\nvalidate_prd]
        S3[Nova — Prototype\nweb · mobile · both\nresolved from productArea]
        S4[Atlas — Solution Architect\nvalidate_architecture\nget_domain_skill_context]
        S5[Apex — Epic Feature Planner\npushEpicAndFeaturesToADO on approval\ninjects story_decomposition_F1 F2 F3]

        subgraph MAR[Multi-Agent Refinement — story_decomposition_Fn]
            direction LR
            MA1[Phase 1 Draft\nall agents in parallel]
            MA2[Phase 2 Refine x2\ncross-agent review]
            MA3[Phase 3 Synthesize\nShard merges final backlog JSON]
        end

        S6[Ivy — Curator\nauto-runs after last stage\nwrites context_diffs]
    end

    subgraph REVIEW[④ Human Checkpoint]
        R1{Human Review}
        R2[✅ Approve]
        R3[✏️ Revise with feedback]
        R4[❌ Reject]
    end

    subgraph ADO[⑤ ADO Push on Approval]
        A1[epic_feature_planner\npushEpicAndFeaturesToADO\ncreates epic + feature shells]
        A2[story_decomposition_Fn\npushFeatureToADO\nadds stories + cumulative test plan]
        A3[stamp artifacts.external_url\nSQLite traceability]
    end

    subgraph POST[⑥ Post-Completion]
        PC1[context_diffs approved\ncontext files updated in place]
        PC2[Change Request system\nassess impact via Coordinator\ntargeted stage re-run]
        PC3[Redo from any stage\nwith feedback propagation]
    end

    START --> P1 --> P2 --> P3 --> P4

    P4 --> S1
    S1 --> S2 --> S3 --> S4 --> S5 --> MAR --> S6

    S1 & S2 & S4 & S5 -.->|each runs via| LOOP
    MAR -.->|runs via| LOOP

    L1 --> L2
    L2 -->|calls tool| L3
    L3 -->|issues| L4 --> L2
    L3 -->|valid| L5 --> L6

    L6 --> R1
    R1 --> R2
    R1 --> R3
    R1 --> R4

    R2 -->|epic_feature_planner| A1
    R2 -->|story_decomposition_Fn| A2
    A1 & A2 --> A3

    R3 -->|feedback injected into brief| L1

    S6 --> PC1
    S6 --> POST
    R4 --> POST

    subgraph PARTICIPANTS[Multi-Agent Participants\nfiltered by productArea]
        PA1[Shard — Product Lead\nalways]
        PA2[Vera — QA\nalways]
        PA3[Finn — Backend\nalways]
        PA4[Remi — Web\nif web in productArea]
        PA5[iOS Cole\nif mobile in productArea]
        PA6[Android Cole\nif mobile in productArea]
    end

    MAR -.- PARTICIPANTS
```

