## 3. Integration Points

| Integration | Provider Options | Direction | Trigger |
|---|---|---|---|
| Roadmap Items | Airtable · none | Inbound | Workflow start — populates item + productArea |
| LLM | Anthropic · AWS Bedrock · Ollama | Bidirectional | Every agent call |
| Work Items | Azure DevOps · Jira · none | Outbound | Checkpoint approval |
| Documentation | Azure Wiki · none | Outbound | Checkpoint approval |
| Knowledge Base | Notion · GitBook · none | Inbound | Coordinator planning phase |
| Context Files | context/*.md on disk | Inbound | Every agent system prompt |

