## 4. Validation Tool → Stage Mapping

| Tool | Stage | What it enforces |
|---|---|---|
| `validate_research_brief` | analyst | ≥5 citations, References section, no fake URLs, assumption count |
| `validate_prd` | pm_prd | Out of Scope, metric baselines, counter-metrics, measurable NFRs, Open Questions |
| `validate_architecture` | solution_architect | No TBDs, Repository Impact section, Cross-Platform Contracts, cost estimates, failure modes |
| `validate_backlog_json` | pm_backlog | story_id format, as_a/i_want/so_that, GWT ACs, Fibonacci points, platform tags, technical ACs, test_cases |
| `validate_gtm_strategy` | gtm_strategy | Moore positioning template, 3 launch phases, leading/lagging indicators, channel recommendations |
| `get_domain_skill_context` | solution_architect · pm_backlog | Loads service-specific patterns from skill_versions DB |

---

## 5. ADO Traceability Chain

```
Airtable item
  └── items.metadata.productArea (SQLite)
        └── workflow (SQLite workflows table)
              └── artifact (SQLite artifacts table)
                    └── artifacts.external_url → ADO URL
                          └── ado_work_item_map (F1.S1 → ADO work item ID)
                                └── Azure DevOps Epic → Feature → Story → Test Plan
```
